{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3730660/extras/LetalInvasion.png?t=1749132355\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Lethal Invasion</strong> is a 3D third-person survival and melee combat game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In Lethal Invasion, survive waves of enemies appearing in each round. In the Early Access version, there will be one map. Each map will feature portals that spawn enemies from other realms\u2014this map features enemies from the <strong>Infernal Realm</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You can equip new weapons by purchasing them with points earned by eliminating enemies, and you\u2019ll also be able to upgrade them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Buy single-use abilities and gear up as best as possible to survive all the rounds.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3730660/extras/GAME_FEATURES.png?t=1749132355\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3730660/extras/ENEMIES.png?t=1749132355\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Enemies from the Infernal Realm\u2014the first and only map in Early Access\u2014can perform various attacks and even dodge yours. As rounds progress, difficulty increases, and enemies will become harder to kill due to higher health, stronger attacks, or more frequent dodges.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3730660/extras/ROUNDS.png?t=1749132355\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In each round, 4 portals will spawn, attracting demons. Each portal has a set enemy limit. Once that limit is cleared, the portal is destroyed. When all 4 portals are destroyed, players advance to the next round, where 4 new portals appear with new enemy caps and potential difficulty enhancements.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3730660/extras/UNLOCKING_NEW_AREAS.png?t=1749132355\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Unlock new areas of the map by purchasing doors. Each door has a protective shield. To remove the shield and gain access, you'll need to gather the required amount of points to open it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3730660/extras/Captura_de_pantalla_2025-05-30_153421.png?t=1749132355\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3730660/extras/POINTS.png?t=1749132355\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Players earn points by eliminating enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3730660/extras/LETALCOIN.png?t=1749132355\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">To get LethalCoin, you must exchange your points for this currency. 1 LethalCoin equals 1,000 points.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3730660/extras/LetalCoin@3x.png?t=1749132355\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3730660/extras/PLAYER_FEATURES.png?t=1749132355\" /></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Dodge enemy attacks</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Perform combo-based melee attacks</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Buy new weapons</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Upgrade weapons</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Purchase single-use abilities</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3730660/extras/PLAYER_ATTACKS_AND_COMBOS.png?t=1749132355\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Players can execute individual or combined attacks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3730660/extras/WEAPON_PURCHASE_UNLOCK.png?t=1749132355\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Each weapon is displayed on walls and protected by a shield. This shield can only be removed using LethalCoin. Only then will you be able to buy the weapon.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3730660/extras/Captura_de_pantalla_2025-05-30_153634.png?t=1749132355\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3730660/extras/WEAPON_PURCHASE.png?t=1749132355\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Players can equip up to two weapons. Weapons are bought using points and can be upgraded to increase your chances of surviving later rounds.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3730660/extras/ABILITY_PURCHASE.png?t=1749132355\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Players can buy single-use abilities with LethalCoin. Multiple abilities are available to significantly enhance the gameplay experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3730660/extras/WEAPON_UPGRADES.png?t=1749132355\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Weapons can be upgraded using LethalCoin. Upgrades will increase weapon damage.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3730660/extras/LANGUAGES.png?t=1749132355\" /></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The game will be available in <strong>Spanish and English</strong>, with more languages coming in the next few months.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3730660/extras/GAME_MODES.png?t=1749132355\" /></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Online</strong>: Play with friends and other players online. Up to 5 players max.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Private Matches</strong>: Play solo or with friends in private lobbies without random players. (This feature will be available in the next update.)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Tutorial</strong>: A tutorial is available so all players can learn the basics. </p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3730660?t=1749132355","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3730660?t=1749132355","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3730660/24c8e9903ddd32bbfe9ab81046cafd4810110f1f/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1749132355","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3730660/24c8e9903ddd32bbfe9ab81046cafd4810110f1f/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1749132355","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3730660/extras/LetalInvasion.png?t=1749132355\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Lethal Invasion</strong> is a 3D third-person survival and melee combat game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In Lethal Invasion, survive waves of enemies appearing in each round. In the Early Access version, there will be one map. Each map will feature portals that spawn enemies from other realms\u2014this map features enemies from the <strong>Infernal Realm</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You can equip new weapons by purchasing them with points earned by eliminating enemies, and you\u2019ll also be able to upgrade them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Buy single-use abilities and gear up as best as possible to survive all the rounds.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3730660/extras/GAME_FEATURES.png?t=1749132355\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3730660/extras/ENEMIES.png?t=1749132355\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Enemies from the Infernal Realm\u2014the first and only map in Early Access\u2014can perform various attacks and even dodge yours. As rounds progress, difficulty increases, and enemies will become harder to kill due to higher health, stronger attacks, or more frequent dodges.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3730660/extras/ROUNDS.png?t=1749132355\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In each round, 4 portals will spawn, attracting demons. Each portal has a set enemy limit. Once that limit is cleared, the portal is destroyed. When all 4 portals are destroyed, players advance to the next round, where 4 new portals appear with new enemy caps and potential difficulty enhancements.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3730660/extras/UNLOCKING_NEW_AREAS.png?t=1749132355\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Unlock new areas of the map by purchasing doors. Each door has a protective shield. To remove the shield and gain access, you'll need to gather the required amount of points to open it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3730660/extras/Captura_de_pantalla_2025-05-30_153421.png?t=1749132355\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3730660/extras/POINTS.png?t=1749132355\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Players earn points by eliminating enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3730660/extras/LETALCOIN.png?t=1749132355\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">To get LethalCoin, you must exchange your points for this currency. 1 LethalCoin equals 1,000 points.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3730660/extras/LetalCoin@3x.png?t=1749132355\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3730660/extras/PLAYER_FEATURES.png?t=1749132355\" /></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Dodge enemy attacks</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Perform combo-based melee attacks</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Buy new weapons</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Upgrade weapons</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Purchase single-use abilities</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3730660/extras/PLAYER_ATTACKS_AND_COMBOS.png?t=1749132355\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Players can execute individual or combined attacks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3730660/extras/WEAPON_PURCHASE_UNLOCK.png?t=1749132355\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Each weapon is displayed on walls and protected by a shield. This shield can only be removed using LethalCoin. Only then will you be able to buy the weapon.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3730660/extras/Captura_de_pantalla_2025-05-30_153634.png?t=1749132355\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3730660/extras/WEAPON_PURCHASE.png?t=1749132355\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Players can equip up to two weapons. Weapons are bought using points and can be upgraded to increase your chances of surviving later rounds.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3730660/extras/ABILITY_PURCHASE.png?t=1749132355\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Players can buy single-use abilities with LethalCoin. Multiple abilities are available to significantly enhance the gameplay experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3730660/extras/WEAPON_UPGRADES.png?t=1749132355\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Weapons can be upgraded using LethalCoin. Upgrades will increase weapon damage.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3730660/extras/LANGUAGES.png?t=1749132355\" /></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The game will be available in <strong>Spanish and English</strong>, with more languages coming in the next few months.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3730660/extras/GAME_MODES.png?t=1749132355\" /></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Online</strong>: Play with friends and other players online. Up to 5 players max.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Private Matches</strong>: Play solo or with friends in private lobbies without random players. (This feature will be available in the next update.)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Tutorial</strong>: A tutorial is available so all players can learn the basics. </p></li></ul>","developers":["Qokust"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3730660/3e70f4a035215d2f92d24e96ee4a2ff75aba2819/header.jpg?t=1749132355","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"name":"Lethal Invasion","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10/ Windows 11<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> 2.0 GHz Dual Core or similar<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Network:</strong> Broadband Internet connection<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 20 GB available space</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10/ Windows 11<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> 2.0 GHz Dual Core or similar<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 16 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Network:</strong> Broadband Internet connection<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 20 GB available space</li></ul>"},"platforms":{"linux":false,"mac":false,"windows":true},"publishers":["Qokust"],"ratings":{"dejus":{"banned":"0","descriptors":"Viol\u00eancia","rating":"10","rating_generated":"1","required_age":"10","use_age_gate":"0"},"steam_germany":{"banned":"0","descriptors":"Gewalt","rating":"12","rating_generated":"1","required_age":"12","use_age_gate":"0"}},"release_date":{"coming_soon":true,"date":"Coming soon"},"required_age":0,"screenshots":[{"id":0,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3730660/ecc8c62270a6d197b816dd7fd2940f85a046328b/ss_ecc8c62270a6d197b816dd7fd2940f85a046328b.1920x1080.jpg?t=1749132355","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3730660/ecc8c62270a6d197b816dd7fd2940f85a046328b/ss_ecc8c62270a6d197b816dd7fd2940f85a046328b.600x338.jpg?t=1749132355"},{"id":1,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3730660/8660b002f072b7de01300386faf2c5513419c897/ss_8660b002f072b7de01300386faf2c5513419c897.1920x1080.jpg?t=1749132355","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3730660/8660b002f072b7de01300386faf2c5513419c897/ss_8660b002f072b7de01300386faf2c5513419c897.600x338.jpg?t=1749132355"},{"id":2,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3730660/1d6a663d1d11a617f8c0ea04ad5cd50a8d3e48dd/ss_1d6a663d1d11a617f8c0ea04ad5cd50a8d3e48dd.1920x1080.jpg?t=1749132355","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3730660/1d6a663d1d11a617f8c0ea04ad5cd50a8d3e48dd/ss_1d6a663d1d11a617f8c0ea04ad5cd50a8d3e48dd.600x338.jpg?t=1749132355"},{"id":3,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3730660/167c96d27ac46957a40333c255b58668ac66a1f7/ss_167c96d27ac46957a40333c255b58668ac66a1f7.1920x1080.jpg?t=1749132355","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3730660/167c96d27ac46957a40333c255b58668ac66a1f7/ss_167c96d27ac46957a40333c255b58668ac66a1f7.600x338.jpg?t=1749132355"},{"id":4,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3730660/84a76874e207edda075fe515e5ffb487fe02ecd1/ss_84a76874e207edda075fe515e5ffb487fe02ecd1.1920x1080.jpg?t=1749132355","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3730660/84a76874e207edda075fe515e5ffb487fe02ecd1/ss_84a76874e207edda075fe515e5ffb487fe02ecd1.600x338.jpg?t=1749132355"},{"id":5,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3730660/303fbc09e87b36aa7c762f0d3c810816d00b6bf1/ss_303fbc09e87b36aa7c762f0d3c810816d00b6bf1.1920x1080.jpg?t=1749132355","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3730660/303fbc09e87b36aa7c762f0d3c810816d00b6bf1/ss_303fbc09e87b36aa7c762f0d3c810816d00b6bf1.600x338.jpg?t=1749132355"},{"id":6,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3730660/1110b59d333b7d61c023ae705fc8477910aa836f/ss_1110b59d333b7d61c023ae705fc8477910aa836f.1920x1080.jpg?t=1749132355","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3730660/1110b59d333b7d61c023ae705fc8477910aa836f/ss_1110b59d333b7d61c023ae705fc8477910aa836f.600x338.jpg?t=1749132355"},{"id":7,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3730660/86e54c75dd9b071515cb642d844265bc65ddbc4d/ss_86e54c75dd9b071515cb642d844265bc65ddbc4d.1920x1080.jpg?t=1749132355","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3730660/86e54c75dd9b071515cb642d844265bc65ddbc4d/ss_86e54c75dd9b071515cb642d844265bc65ddbc4d.600x338.jpg?t=1749132355"}],"short_description":"Lethal Invasion is a 3D third-person survival and melee combat game. Fight off increasingly stronger hordes of enemies. Upgrade your weapons, buy single-use skills, and unlock new map areas as you try to survive alone or in online co-op.","steam_appid":3730660,"support_info":{"email":"qokustsuport@gmail.com","url":""},"supported_languages":"English, Spanish - Spain","type":"game","website":null}